{"ref":"character:iguana-gallo-valletto","lead":[{"k":"p","c":["Iguana Gallo Valletto is a playable character from the base game version of Vampire Survivors that was introduced in Patch 0.6.1. Their starting weapon is the ",{"i":"Sprite-Clock_Lancet.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:clock-lancet"}," ",{"t":"Clock Lancet","r":"weapon:clock-lancet"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Character","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["23 May 2022 (Update)"]]},{"label":"Alias","cells":[["Gallo"]]},{"label":"Character ID","cells":[["PINO"]]},{"label":"Skin ID","cells":[["DEFAULT"]]},{"label":"Starting weapon","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Clock_Lancet.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"weapon:clock-lancet"}," ",{"t":"Clock Lancet","r":"weapon:clock-lancet"}]]},{"label":"Unlocked by","cells":[["Obtain the ",{"t":"Infinite Corridor","r":"weapon:infinite-corridor"}]]},{"label":"Cost","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 2,000"]]},{"label":"Secret","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Ignores walls","cells":[["No"]]},{"label":"Theme","cells":[["No"]]}]},{"title":"Initial stats","rows":[{"label":"Max Health","cells":[["100"]]},{"label":"Duration","cells":[["+15%"]]},{"label":"Cooldown","cells":[["-15%"]]},{"label":"Greed","cells":[["-50%"]]},{"label":"Reroll","cells":[["+5"]]},{"label":"Skip","cells":[["+5"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"unlocking","title":"Unlocking","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["The player can unlock this character by obtaining the ",{"i":"Sprite-Infinite_Corridor.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:infinite-corridor"}," ",{"t":"Infinite Corridor","r":"weapon:infinite-corridor"},". They must then be purchased for ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 2,000, which scales with other characters purchased."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, they can be unlocked in the ",{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"waitreaction\"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"passive-bonuses","title":"Passive bonuses","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Gallo starts with with 1 extra level, +15% ",{"i":"Sprite-Spellbinder.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:duration"}," ",{"t":"Duration","r":"powerup:duration"},", -15% ",{"i":"Sprite-Empty_Tome.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:cooldown"}," ",{"t":"Cooldown","r":"powerup:cooldown"},", -50% ",{"i":"Sprite-Stone_Mask.png","w":15,"h":12,"r":"powerup:greed"}," ",{"t":"Greed","r":"powerup:greed"},", +5 ",{"i":"Sprite-Reroll.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"powerup:reroll"}," ",{"t":"Reroll","r":"powerup:reroll"},", and +5 ",{"i":"Sprite-Skip.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:skip"}," ",{"t":"Skip","r":"powerup:skip"},". They gain +10% ",{"i":"Sprite-Crown.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:growth"}," ",{"t":"Growth","r":"powerup:growth"}," every 5 levels up to level 25. The maximum Growth gained this way is +50%."]},{"k":"p","c":["The following table shows how much ",{"i":"Sprite-Crown.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:growth"}," ",{"t":"Growth","r":"powerup:growth"}," they gain by level:"]},{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Levels"],"h":1},{"c":["Growth"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":["1-4"]},{"c":["0%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["5-9"]},{"c":["+10%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["10-14"]},{"c":["+20%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["15-19"]},{"c":["+30%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["20-24"]},{"c":["+40%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["25+"]},{"c":["+50%"]}]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"tips","title":"Tips","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Picking ",{"i":"Sprite-Out_of_Bounds_(XII).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"weapon:out-of-bounds-xii"}," ",{"t":"Out of Bounds (XII)","r":"weapon:out-of-bounds-xii"}," or ",{"i":"Sprite-Blood_Astronomia_(XXI).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"weapon:blood-astronomia-xxi"}," ",{"t":"Blood Astronomia (XXI)","r":"weapon:blood-astronomia-xxi"}," as the starting Arcana allows Clock Lancet to deal damage, negating the necessity to pick a damaging weapon on Gallo's second level."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Iguana_Gallo_Valletto.png","w":120,"h":120,"c":["Iguana Gallo Valletto's sprite"]},{"i":"Animated-Iguana_Gallo_Valletto.gif","w":112,"h":120,"c":["Movement animation"]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 23 May 2022 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Gallo may have created ",{"t":"Gallo Tower","r":"stage:gallo-tower"},", the teleporting mirrors, and the Relics there. They are also seen holding the ",{"i":"Sprite-Empty_Tome.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:empty-tome"}," ",{"t":"Empty Tome","r":"passive:empty-tome"},"."]},{"c":["Gallo and ",{"i":"Sprite-Divano_Thelma.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:divano-thelma"}," ",{"t":"Divano Thelma","r":"character:divano-thelma"}," are the only two non-secret characters to be left out of the dev log. Despite this, they are not secret characters because they have unlock requirements explained in-game as well as related achievements."]},{"c":["Gallo, ",{"i":"Sprite-Christine_Davain.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:christine-davain"}," ",{"t":"Christine Davain","r":"character:christine-davain"},", and ",{"i":"Sprite-Divano_Thelma.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:divano-thelma"}," ",{"t":"Divano Thelma","r":"character:divano-thelma"}," are the only characters that start with an extra level."],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["They all start with an extra level so that the player can pick up an extra weapon, either because their starting weapon does not deal damage, or in Christine's case, her weapon, the ",{"i":"Sprite-Pentagram.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:pentagram"}," ",{"t":"Pentagram","r":"weapon:pentagram"},", has a massive cooldown."]}]}},{"c":["Gallo's design is most likely inspired by Lezard Valeth from the Valkyrie Profile franchise, with his visuals being more specifically inspired by Lezard's outfit from Valkyrie Profile 2: Slimeria."]}]}],"subs":[]}]}